# THE ORACLE PINS — which legend-engine / legend-pure release is the spec, as the
# TESTS read it (parser-equivalence's OraclePins, the fixture snapshot's header
# check). docs/UPSTREAM_BOUNDARY_PROGRAM.md §3 A: one release.
#
# The build's own copy of the release is MODULE.bazel (LEGEND_ENGINE_RELEASE /
# LEGEND_PURE_RELEASE: the jars, and the source archives pinned by sha256).
# //tools/deps:one_release fails the build if the two ever name different
# releases, or if a tag below is not that release's.
#
# THE RULE: the sources pin a RELEASE TAG, never an arbitrary commit. Jars exist
# only at release tags, so a non-tag source pin makes an identical oracle jar
# impossible and the parser differential (gate 8) has to hand-adjudicate every
# construct on either side of the divergence (docs/version-skew-claims.tsv was 25
# rows of that rent at 4.137.0+36).
#
#   LEGEND_ENGINE_RELEASE   the release
#   LEGEND_PURE_RELEASE     DERIVED: the <legend.pure.version> that engine
#                           release's own pom declares — nobody types a pure
#                           version independently
#   *_SHA                   the COMMIT the tag points to (the tag object itself is
#                           a different SHA)
#   *_DESCRIBE              the tag name, == legend-<repo>-<RELEASE> exactly
#
# Bumping = `bazel run //tools/bump -- <engine release>`: it derives the pure
# release from the engine release's pom on Maven Central, resolves the two tag
# commits, rewrites MODULE.bazel and this file, repins, regenerates every
# generated file and runs every gate; then the judgement half — re-pin every
# moved row with a reason (docs/UPSTREAM_BOUNDARY_HOMEWORK_2026_09_10.md §5
# phases 3-6). Pins may only name what Central has published: tags and Central
# disagree (4.142.0 is tagged and unpublished); the bump refuses otherwise.
#
# Plain KEY=VALUE, no quotes, no expansion.
LEGEND_ENGINE_RELEASE=4.145.0
LEGEND_PURE_RELEASE=5.99.0
LEGEND_ENGINE_REPO=finos/legend-engine
LEGEND_ENGINE_SHA=230c159196d6512486fd382556c5e9e4fb128ebb
LEGEND_ENGINE_DESCRIBE=legend-engine-4.145.0
LEGEND_PURE_REPO=finos/legend-pure
LEGEND_PURE_SHA=7fbc7d6e8d52e2488bdae67280e5f5dfed448d68
LEGEND_PURE_DESCRIBE=legend-pure-5.99.0
